        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/doppelgangerung/{size}/1876_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-08-10T22:35:23.540Z",
        "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/f/f9ddc170cfef96f32309600fb141b7e5ba66be15.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/f9ddc170cfef96f32309600fb141b7e5ba66be15\" title=\"Screenshot_20220809-230433\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f9ddc170cfef96f32309600fb141b7e5ba66be15_2_219x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_20220809-230433\" data-base62-sha1=\"zEpZXCUs2xobph6l0FsgQ77cIKh\" width=\"219\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f9ddc170cfef96f32309600fb141b7e5ba66be15_2_219x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f9ddc170cfef96f32309600fb141b7e5ba66be15_2_328x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f9ddc170cfef96f32309600fb141b7e5ba66be15_2_438x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f9ddc170cfef96f32309600fb141b7e5ba66be15_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_20220809-230433</span><span class=\"informations\">1080×2460 175 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div><br>\nAn uncomplicated, if not painless, Mint - the last Forced Redeployment hit hard just before the end, taking Guise out - but with only 2 HP left, Wrathful Retribution punched hard even through a half dozen minions, and a Haka Of Battle-enhanced Taiaha delivered the final blow.</p>",
