        "cooked": "<p>For some reason, my attempt to get the Fanatic Blender going was stymied, and I really have no idea why. Probably should have reported that as a bug, oops. c.c</p>\n<p>But it was an easy victory regardless. I forget the details, but everything else went pretty well. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
